WEBVTT

00:07:29.751 --> 00:07:31.431
to tackle any problem.

00:07:31.767 --> 00:07:34.855
I do this work because you showed me

00:07:34.879 --> 00:07:36.872
that resilience, love and knowledge

00:07:36.896 --> 00:07:38.624
are enough to make a difference.

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:41.847
I want to go back to Mexico and visit you.

00:07:41.871 --> 00:07:45.137
I want to show you the pictures
of the things that I have done.

00:07:45.161 --> 00:07:47.482
I want to show you the climate legislation

00:07:47.506 --> 00:07:49.233
that we've been able to pass.

00:07:49.257 --> 00:07:50.964
I want to smell the flowers

00:07:50.988 --> 00:07:53.460
and fight for climate justice
alongside you.

00:07:54.179 --> 00:07:55.361
Te quiero mucho.

00:07:55.385 --> 00:07:56.551
I love you.

00:07:56.575 --> 00:07:57.734
Xiye.

00:07:58.273 --> 00:08:01.777
[Te quiero mucho. Xiye.]